# AES keys are secrets — never commit them. Keys are provisioned at runtime over
# the control topic, or supplied via a local key file for offline replay.
*.keys
*key*.json
keys.jsonl
# LoRaWAN join credentials hold per-device AppKeys — local only, never committed
# (see docs/LORA_JOIN_REHEARSAL.md).
*creds*.json
# Durable join/device stores and radio capture dumps are bench artifacts.
*.redb
join-frames*.jsonl
/target
